# Print job automation — training project

Python OOP + Robot Framework test suite for simulating
and testing Xerox print jobs.

## Setup
```
pip install robotframework
sudo apt install cups cups-pdf
sudo systemctl start cups
```

## Project structure
- `printjob.py` — PrintJob, ColorPrintJob, BWPrintJob, PrintQueue classes
- `log_parser.py` — LogEntry and LogParser for CUPS log analysis
- `resources/keywords.py` — Robot Framework keyword library
- `tests/` — Robot test suites

## Run the tests
```
robot --outputdir results tests/
```
Open `results/log.html` to see results.